<h3><u>Haaye Shabbir bayabaan ko</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><span class=""Apple-style-span"" 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><u><font size=""4""><p>(Ya husain, wa hussain) x2<br>(wa hussain) x2<br>(Haaye Shabbir bayabaa(n) ko basaanay ke liye) x3</p></font></u></span><span class=""Apple-style-span"" 'times="""" new="""" roman';="""" line-height:="""" normal;="""" font-size:="""" medium;="""" ""=""""><font size=""4""><ol><li>(Deen ki rah mai(n) bhare ghar ko) x2 lutane ke liye</li><p>(Haaye Shabbir bayabaa(n) ko basaane ke liye) x3</p><li>(Apnay gulshan se chunnay phool bahatar shah-e-deen) x2</li><p>(Karbala dekh teri god) x2 sajane ke liye</p><p>(Haaye Shabbir bayabaa(n) ko basaane ke liye) x3</p><li>(Laal Zehra ka challa bakshish-e-ummat ke liye) x2</li><p>(bundh khanjar ke tale sar) x2 wo kataane ke liye</p><p>(Haaye Shabbir bayabaa(n) ko basaane ke liye) x3</p><li>(Ali Asgher ne Musalmaano se paani maanga) x2</li><p>(Haaye ik teer milla pyaas) x2 bhujaane ke liye</p><p>(Haaye Shabbir bayabaa(n) ko basaane ke liye) x3</p><li>(Hakim-e-Shaam ko ghalkaar ke bole Abbas) x2</li><p>(Merai bazu hai(n) tera naksh) x2 mitaane ke liye</p><p>(Haaye Shabbir bayabaa(n) ko basaane ke liye) x3</p><li>(Bint-e-Zehra tere parde ki khuda khair kare) x2</li><p>(qalma goh aaye hai(n) khayyam) x2 jalaane ke liye</p><p>(Haaye Shabbir bayabaa(n) ko basaane ke liye) x3</p><li>(Shah-e-Dee(n) Qasim-o-Asgher ko nichawar kar ke) x2</li><p>(Ali Akber ki challe laash) x2 uthaane ke liye</p><p>(Haaye Shabbir bayabaa(n) ko basaane ke liye) x3</p><li>(Daali ""Gulzaar"" ne jab haal-e-Saqifa pai nazar) x2</li></ol><p>(Sara manzar tha yeh Zehra ko) x2 rulaane ke liye</p><p>(Haaye Shabbir bayabaa(n) ko basaane ke liye) x3</p></font></span></p>
                 